R:pilot
R:@tier engine
R:@desc Mario walks RIGHT under injected input — X_POS strictly increases
R:@level smb_w1_1-standalone.iff
R:@needs player as #P
R:@expect-exit 0
R:@expect-out PASS
R:@screenshot walk_right.png
PS:
WA:#P X_POS
IN:joystick1_raw BTN_RIGHT held -1
ST:8
C:#x0 = mb(X_POS, #P)
T:start X = $#x0
C:#goal = #x0 + 1
ST:200
WM:#P X_POS > #goal timeout 5.0
M:#last > #x0
SH:walk_right.png
ST:1
TY:PASS — Mario walked RIGHT from $#x0 to X=$#last
TN:FAIL — Mario stalled at X=$#last (start $#x0)
JN:*fail
E:
*fail
EX:1
